  "content": "\n\n[![Modrinth - 我的其他项目](https://img.shields.io/badge/modrinth-My_other_projects-00AF5C?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth)](https://modrinth.com/user/Jacosvaldo)\n[![Discord - Jacosvaldo 的“不太酷”服务器](https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-Jacosvaldo%27s%20_Not_Too_Cool_Server-5865F2?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord)](https://discord.com/invite/cPYyf3JqgU)\n[![Ko-fi - 打赏我](https://img.shields.io/badge/kofi-Tip_me-F26B2E?style=for-the-badge&logo=kofi)](https://ko-fi.com/jacosvaldo)\n\n## 🧩 依赖项\n[Fusion](https://modrinth.com/mod/fusion-connected-textures) 是必需的！\n\n## ⚠️ 连通纹理系列\n此纹理属于一个系列。建议同时查看 [连通路径 (Fusion)](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/connected-paths-(fusion) 和 [连通岩石 (Fusion)](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/connected-rocks-(fusion)。\n\n## 🛠️ 模组支持\n\n如需模组支持，请使用本材质包的 Continuity 模组版本：[连通砖块](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/connected-bricks)\n\n## 💼 我的作品\n\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/connected-paths\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Nyfj98b5/images/d2f6fe5c972e45223b8cf11208ffffeb83e41dda.png\" alt=\"连通路径\" width=\"204\"> </a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/connected-rocks\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/IE9kFeq9/images/5bf749f3cb7aaadbea0f7d466e778caad31ede30.png\" alt=\"连通岩石\" width=\"204\"> </a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/connected-bricks\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/mnKF5Qd2/images/661274f70b3404470a9a6097f138a09f1c09bd2e.png\" alt=\"连通砖块\" width=\"204\"> </a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/void-dragon\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/2mCxIlku/images/669e421ccdfbcbc3b89ab705976712e53500a1c0.png\" alt=\"虚空龙\" width=\"204\"> </a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/emissive-lanterns\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/n09olmOJ/images/ee19a80fb28a236ca9f25fb294172b400ef336fb.png\" alt=\"自发光灯笼\" width=\"204\"> </a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/enchanting-table-magic-circle\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f4838d8cfdbd75d3cca8bb063cab8e3d154107e5.png\" alt=\"附魔台魔法阵\" width=\"204\"> </a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/better-enchanting-table\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/d9PIjVLE/images/3c67b63c7e5a4be75edaa9f05a0f10b66b3bf75d.png\" alt=\"更好的附魔台\" width=\"204\"> </a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/vanilla-better-enchanting-table\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/uE1RvdVA/images/0ddf81551efb39604028c735fc619393f591f17a.png\" alt=\"原版风格更好的附魔台\" width=\"204\"> </a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/fast-better-grass-for-simple-grass-flowers\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/pOumd1F9/images/86315d23cee01bdef72d659243e9ef907ec97792.png\" alt=\"简单花草快速更好草地\" width=\"204\"> </a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/better-lily-pads_\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/64TlNiYG/images/05a52d02b3e57e9037838fa1826d1c74249c0a25.png\" alt=\"更好的睡莲\" width=\"204\"> </a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/vanilla-better-lily-pads\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/CnUjp8e3/images/f3e079e5f3ee6f28b357e83370096997ad580cca.png\" alt=\"原版风格更好的睡莲\" width=\"204\"> </a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/vanilla-bushy-leaves\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/JKvJahJC/images/fa6dc4969d6f61c5d4e4727fd06e9bdee08ec1e3.png\" alt=\"原版风格茂密树叶\" width=\"204\"> </a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/sweeter-vanilla\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Qgy3TXWA/images/63736f4117ba3647291de6bec87f0578eb18232f.png\" alt=\"甜化原版\" width=\"204\"> </a>\n\n[![使用代码 JACOS 在 Sparked Host 服务器享受 25% 折扣](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c027e7de8616ac177d4267980d53eaacfa9e2022_0.webp)](https://billing.sparkedhost.com/aff.php?aff=3074)",
